<BaseLayout title="Writing — The Starkonium Times" description="Writing and the Blogger archive of The Starkonium Times."><Container as="section" class="page"><p class="eyebrow">Writing</p><h1>Notes, essays &amp; the blog</h1><p>My earlier writing lives on Blogger. The plan is to keep those posts available at <strong>blog.starkonium.com</strong> after the domain cutover, preserving the original archive rather than replacing it with placeholder posts.</p><p><strong>Before DNS changes:</strong> the Blogger archive remains at <a href="https://www.starkonium.com/">www.starkonium.com</a>. After Blogger is configured for the subdomain, use <a href="https://blog.starkonium.com/">blog.starkonium.com</a>.</p><p>Original articles will be added to this section as they are migrated and verified.</p></Container></BaseLayout><style>.page{padding-block:clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem);min-height:55vh}h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)}p{max-width:65ch;line-height:1.8;margin-block:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--orange);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}</style>
